					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Oh geez, the SPC. I don't think I'm nearly radical enough to contribute, but by jove if I don't try! Would the rather embarrassingly-misspelled <em>SCP</em> Foundation's ideas critique thread be an acceptable place to begin brainstorming SPC-001 proposals, or is that inferior clone's website too frail to handle the sheer shark-punchitude of SPC-001 proposals?</p> <p>A-ahem-hem, I want to contribute to the joke but am feeling a little intimidated by the quality of these jokes.</p> 
				 	]]>
